            "finding": "Individually inspected exact whole 目上/メウエ; lemma 目上; 名詞/普通名詞/一般/*; *; *; aType 0,3. 1535490 superior/senior noun; noautomaticage-onlyrestriction; exactrole2602209920,3.",
