            "finding": "Dictionary-form cell of the exact head 急行/きゅうこう read; accent_top positions [0] (0 = no accent_top). Exact whole rows exist but none of the headword own lemma fits the selected role with a numeric accent (rows of a homographic other lemma are a different word): 急行/キュウコウ; lemma 急行; 名詞/普通名詞/サ変可能/*; *; *; aType 0. No transfer.",
