            "attribution": "National Institute for Japanese Language and Linguistics; modified BSD license",
            "patterns": [
              2
            ],
            "finding": "Exact whole 倒す/タオス; lemma 倒す; 動詞/一般/*/*; 五段-サ行; 終止形-一般; aType 2. Rejected for this role: 倒す/タオス; lemma 倒す; 動詞/一般/*/*; 五段-サ行; 連体形-一般; aType 2.",
