            "attribution": "National Institute for Japanese Language and Linguistics; modified BSD license",
            "patterns": [
              3
            ],
            "finding": "Exact whole おかしい/オカシイ; lemma 可笑しい; 形容詞/一般/*/*; 形容詞; 終止形-一般; aType 3. Rejected for this role: おかしい/オカシイ; lemma 可笑しい; 形容詞/一般/*/*; 形容詞; 連体形-一般; aType 3.",
