            "attribution": "National Institute for Japanese Language and Linguistics; modified BSD license",
            "patterns": [
              2
            ],
            "finding": "Exact whole なさる/ナサル; lemma 為さる; 動詞/非自立可能/*/*; 五段-ラ行; 終止形-一般; aType 2. Rejected for this role: なさる/ナサル; lemma 為さる; 動詞/非自立可能/*/*; 五段-ラ行; 連体形-一般; aType 2.",
