            "attribution": "National Institute for Japanese Language and Linguistics; modified BSD license",
            "patterns": [
              0
            ],
            "finding": "Exact whole 眠る/ネムル; lemma 眠る; 動詞/一般/*/*; 五段-ラ行; 終止形-一般; aType 0. Rejected for this role: 眠る/ネムル; lemma 眠る; 動詞/一般/*/*; 五段-ラ行; 連体形-一般; aType 0.",
