            "locator": "https://clrd.ninjal.ac.jp/unidic_archive/2512/unidic-cwj-202512.zip#sys.dic@65663427",
            "attribution": "National Institute for Japanese Language and Linguistics; modified BSD license",
            "patterns": [
              1
            ],
            "finding": "Exact whole 打つ/ウツ; lemma 打つ; 動詞/一般/*/*; 五段-タ行; 終止形-一般; aType 1. Rejected for this role: 打つ/ウツ; lemma 打つ; 動詞/一般/*/*; 五段-タ行; 連体形-一般; aType 1.",
